== text form (-G: no window, stdio session):
   /nix/store/zffcffb4jsvagwf98sa5vbqp87753zms-drawterm-19.06/bin/drawterm -G -s '' -O cpu=127.0.0.1,auth=tcp!127.0.0.1!5670,user=glenda
